* Variables

The ⟪GTI18N_bcb1b5e1_000001⟫var⟪GTI18N_bcb1b5e1_000002⟫ statement declares a list of variables; as in function argument lists, the type is last.

A ⟪GTI18N_bcb1b5e1_000003⟫var⟪GTI18N_bcb1b5e1_000004⟫ statement can be at package or function level. We see both in this example.

